
# GITHUB RELEASES

## GitHub Releases

- GitHub Releases are used to publish specific versions of a project.

- For example:

    MyProject v1.0

- A release can contain:
    - Version information
    - Release notes
    - Changes
    - Downloadable files

- Releases are useful when making software available to users.

